Most of the abundances for the light and the iron-group elements were determined via equivalent width measurement of a selection of unblended lines. Exceptions are Li, C, N, and O, for which synthesis spectra were directly compared to the observed spectrum. The linelist used for all light and iron-peak elements will be published together with the analysis of the complete sample of our Large Program. For the compilation of this linelist, we used the VALD2 compilation of Kupka et al. [@vald2].

